# Mapping Aspirin Medication Data to FHIR R4 MedicationResource

## ⚠️ Important Caveat Upfront

The retrieved evidence contains **only Condition resources** (SNOMED-coded diagnoses like sinusitis, atrial fibrillation, and asthma). **None of the retrieved context contains Medication resource examples.** I will not fabricate specific examples from the evidence, but I can provide accurate, standards-based guidance.

